{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a thrilling sci-fi racer with StarBoost that redefines gravity: Master <strong>360\u00b0 action, high-speed flight, and intense parcour</strong> to prove your skills and become the <strong>Intergalactic Champion</strong>. Pick your <strong>Racing Captain</strong>, qualify for the <strong>tournament</strong>, and race to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boost, strafe, survive!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>agile space fighters</strong> to <strong>precision parcour artists</strong>, adapt to the challenges ahead. Dodge asteroids, <strong>blast rivals into obstacles</strong>, and stay ahead of the pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras/838168f1a9093302721d79d2ef562a46.avif?t=1748025719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras_big/838168f1a9093302721d79d2ef562a46.avif?t=1748025719 width=800 height=376 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>360\u00b0 Action Racing &amp; Limitless Parcours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The racetracks are designed to challenge your dexterity and reflexes. 360\u00b0 degree action racing offers countless opportunities for very unique racing experiences. Switch between <strong>Free Flight</strong> for exploration or <strong>Lane Magnetism</strong> to gain speed and precision. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Space Battle &amp; Factions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks and attract <strong>rival factions</strong>\u2014each offering unique racing contracts, upgrades, and storylines. Your choices impact the world, shaping your path in the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras/660168c0fd692b02ec18b1da6777a771.poster.avif?t=1748025719\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras/660168c0fd692b02ec18b1da6777a771.webm?t=1748025719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras/660168c0fd692b02ec18b1da6777a771.mp4?t=1748025719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleet &amp; Powerups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win races to gain more money and be able to buy other racing ships. Upgrade your racer, unlock powerups, and customize your <strong>loadout</strong> to fit your playstyle\u2014whether you're a <strong>collector, a street racer, or a fighter</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Reactive World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions have consequences. Do you keep the track clean, or leave wreckage behind, altering future races? The <strong>tournament evolves</strong> based on your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek <strong>hidden shortcuts, strategic items, and alternate routes</strong>. There\u2019s always a choice\u2014but which path leads to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the tournament. Unlock new planets. Conquer the galaxy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now \u2013 StarBoost launches into Early Access mid-2025!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support development by wishlisting on here Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras/f3126bf28e13c8a6c11ca004cf290201.avif?t=1748025719\" width=500 height=122 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2471590?t=1748025719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748025719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/4e83ad4af2f14277fa65f55ac96b1c4199f23c94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748025719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/4e83ad4af2f14277fa65f55ac96b1c4199f23c94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748025719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a thrilling sci-fi racer with StarBoost that redefines gravity: Master <strong>360\u00b0 action, high-speed flight, and intense parcour</strong> to prove your skills and become the <strong>Intergalactic Champion</strong>. Pick your <strong>Racing Captain</strong>, qualify for the <strong>tournament</strong>, and race to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boost, strafe, survive!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>agile space fighters</strong> to <strong>precision parcour artists</strong>, adapt to the challenges ahead. Dodge asteroids, <strong>blast rivals into obstacles</strong>, and stay ahead of the pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras/838168f1a9093302721d79d2ef562a46.avif?t=1748025719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras_big/838168f1a9093302721d79d2ef562a