trong>tournament evolves</strong> based on your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek <strong>hidden shortcuts, strategic items, and alternate routes</strong>. There\u2019s always a choice\u2014but which path leads to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the tournament. Unlock new planets. Conquer the galaxy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now \u2013 StarBoost launches into Early Access mid-2025!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support development by wishlisting on here Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/extras/f3126bf28e13c8a6c11ca004cf290201.avif?t=1748025719\" width=500 height=122 /></span></p>","developers":["Boldheadstudio","www.boldheadstudio.com"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471590/header.jpg?t=1748025719","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved. \u00a9 2025 BoldheadStudio GbR.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2471590/827448/80a96bebfe74e71e70948fa3ceb7afe3182a8866/1750922509/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739441721","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2471590/827448/80a96bebfe74e71e70948fa3ceb7afe3182a8866/1750922509/dash_h264.mpd?t=1